# Claude Code
# Everything under .claude/ is local/internal (strategy docs, settings.local.json,
# scratch data) and must NEVER be published. The ONE exception is .claude/rules/,
# which holds the path-scoped subsystem guides split out of CLAUDE.md — those are
# shared contributor documentation and have to be tracked to reach anyone else.
# Keep this as `.claude/*` (not `.claude/`): git does not descend into an ignored
# DIRECTORY, so a bare `.claude/` makes the un-ignore below unreachable.
.claude/*
!.claude/rules/
# Belt and braces: only markdown may ever be tracked under rules/, so a stray
# note, key, or data file dropped in there stays ignored.
.claude/rules/*
!.claude/rules/*.md
.omc/
.mcp.json

# Superpowers skill output (internal planning artifacts, not for OSS)
docs/superpowers/
.plans/
.specs/
.gstack/

# Per-release pre-release test logs are committed (for reference) — see
# tests/results/. They're small markdown files, one per release run, and
# serve as a record of what was verified at release time.
